    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1019">

                <pb facs="0952" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg638"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/752</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The British Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Spring
                        Rice</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>British Embassy</placeName>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-24">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">November 24, 1914</hi>.</date>
                    <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received November 25</hi>.] </dateline>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Lansing</hi>: With reference to your letter of the 20th
                        instant<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1019-f1"/> and previous correspondence
                    respecting the Italian S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Amistà</hi>, Sir Edward
                        Grey desires me to inform you that he has only just heard that
                    this vessel did in fact put into Barbados on October 28, in accordance with her
                    clearance papers. I am to express to you Sir Edward
                        Grey’s regret for the inaccuracy on this point which was, quite
                    unintentionally, contained in my note No. 371 of the 31st ultimo.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d1019-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cecil Spring Rice</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
